OL,3,GNEWSAWorcestershire north-south split
OL,4,Ato go ahead in 2029
OL,5,
OL,6,FA historic shake-up of councils across
OL,7,FWorcestershire is set to go ahead
OL,8,Fdespite a 12-month delay - with the
OL,9,Fcounty due to be carved in two.
OL,11,FLocal government minister Jim McMahon
OL,12,Fhas confirmed a prior decision to
OL,13,Festablish two new unitary councils for
OL,14,FWorcestershire can be implemented after
OL,15,Fa review - but only in 2029, a year
OL,16,Flater than planned.
OL,18,FThe move will see all the county's
OL,19,Fcurrent councils abolished - the
OL,20,Fbiggest political change since 1974.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
