OL,3,GNEWSAWorcestershire north-south split
OL,4,Ato go ahead in 2029
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Matthew Jenkins, said:
OL,7,F"It's not ideal, but at least it gives
OL,8,Fus clarity of where we are going now."
OL,9,FAdam Kent, his deputy, described the
OL,10,Fdelay as "madness", especially because
OL,11,Fhe favours a single unitary authority
OL,12,Ffor the county.
